      "notes": [
        {
          "category": "summary",
          "text": "Red Hat OpenStack Services on OpenShift (RHOSO) 18.0.22 containers are now available.",
          "title": "Topic"
        },
        {
          "category": "general",
          "text": "Red Hat OpenStack Services on OpenShift is a hybrid cloud solution for deploying and managing virtualized and containerized applications in a scalable infrastructure with a Red Hat OpenShift Container Platform (RHOCP) control plane.\n\nSecurity Fixes:\n* golang: crypto/x509: Man-in-the-middle attacks via untrusted intermediate certificates (CVE-2026-111943)\n\n* golang: golang crypto/x509: Denial of Service via excessive processing of DNS SAN entries (CVE-2026-27145)\n\n* golang: Go crypto/tls: Denial of Service via multiple TLS 1.3 key update messages (CVE-2026-32283)\n\n* golang: Go encoding/asn1: Denial of Service via excessive recursion in Unmarshal (CVE-2026-33818)\n\n* golang: Golang MIME: Denial of Service via maliciously-crafted MIME header (CVE-2026-42504)\n\n* golang: Go net/http: Unencrypted HTTP/2 connections vulnerable to Denial of Service (CVE-2026-56853)\n\n* golang: Go html/template: Cross-Site Scripting via pathological input (CVE-2026-56858)\n\n* golang: Go: Denial of Service via XML decoding recursion depth issue (CVE-2026-56859)\n\n* golang: golang net/url: Denial of Service from quadratic complexity in path resolution (CVE-2026-56860)\n\n* golang: Golang crypto/tls: Denial of Service via indefinite KeyUpdate messages (CVE-2026-56862)",
          "title": "Details"
        },
        {
          "category": "legal_disclaimer",
